(text "PCM2903C on its own USB 2.0 Type-C port. TI documents the PCM2903C self-powered only (SBFS038A\nFigure 41), so a 3.3 V LDO makes its supply from this port's VBUS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "53ec6d3e-62a1-49a6-8d57-48625980366c"))
